"Identifies a preallocated connection created by "
":ref:`FmodSystem.create_dsp_connection()<class_FmodSystem_method_create_dsp_connection>` for "
"attaching through "
":ref:`FmodDSP.add_input_preallocated()<class_FmodDSP_method_add_input_preallocated>`."
msgstr ""
"表示预分配连接，通过  "
":ref:`FmodSystem.create_dsp_connection()<class_FmodSystem_method_create_dsp_connection>`  "
"创建，再通过  :ref:`FmodDSP.add_input_preallocated()<class_FmodDSP_method_add_input_preallocated>`"
"  接入。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddspconnection.rst:193 8413c6235c9f45aa8cf1c3a876c685bb
msgid ""
"\\ ``outchannels`` and ``inchannels`` must be between ``1`` and ``32``. ``inchannel_hop`` is "
"the row stride: ``0`` uses ``inchannels``; otherwise it must be at least ``inchannels`` and "
"at most ``32``."
msgstr ""
"``outchannels``  和  ``inchannels``  必须在  ``1``  到  ``32``  之间。\\  ``inchannel_hop``  是行步长：\\"
"  ``0``  表示使用  ``inchannels`` \\ ，其他值必须不小于  ``inchannels``  且不大于  ``32`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddspconnection.rst:195 d34b46e1aa65458ea0dbc660222a3717
msgid ""
"The input must contain at least ``(outchannels - 1) * effective_hop + inchannels`` elements. "
"Padding after the last row is optional. Invalid dimensions, strides, and short arrays are "
"rejected before calling FMOD; the caller's array is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"输入数组至少包含  ``(outchannels - 1) * effective_hop + inchannels``  "
"个元素，最后一行末尾可省略填充。无效尺寸、步长和过短数组会在调用 FMOD 前被拒绝，不会修改调用方数组。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddspconnection.rst:207 2d795fe72968403aab7941de49ffd0ef
msgid ""
"Returns the connection's matrix in row-major order, using ``outchannels`` rows and a row "
"stride of ``inchannel_hop``, or ``inchannels`` when the stride is ``0``. The array contains "
"``outchannels * effective_hop`` elements, including zero-filled padding and unused rows or "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"按行优先顺序返回连接矩阵，共  ``outchannels``  行。行步长为  ``inchannel_hop`` \\ ，步长为  ``0``  时使用  "
"``inchannels`` \\ 。返回数组包含  ``outchannels * effective_hop``  个元素，填充以及未使用的行列均为零。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddspconnection.rst:209 932f78278da0450e9b82053ca28c4d5e
msgid ""
"Channel counts must be between ``1`` and ``32``. An explicit stride must be between "
"``inchannels`` and ``32``. The requested dimensions must hold the actual FMOD matrix; "
"otherwise an empty array is returned and an error is reported."
msgstr ""
"通道数必须在  ``1``  到  ``32``  之间。显式步长必须在  ``inchannels``  到  ``32``  之间。请求尺寸必须能容纳 FMOD "
"的实际矩阵，否则返回空数组并报告错误。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmoddspconnection.rst:211 9c7c3995ae1d46ac9054483d37486870
msgid ""
"FMOD writes into a separate buffer sized for its maximum channel width before values are "
"copied to the returned array. Native dimensions cannot overflow a smaller requested "
"destination."
msgstr "FMOD 先将数据写入按最大通道宽度分配的独立缓冲区，再复制到返回数组；实际矩阵尺寸不会导致较小的请求目标越界。"
